<section id="about" class="section section--cream intro reveal">
  <div class="wrap intro__grid">
    <div class="intro__header">
      <p class="eyebrow_inner">Our Philosophy</p>
      <h2 class="intro__lead">
        If there is life, there is sound. The soundscape is the most honest metric of an ecosystem's health.
      </h2>
    </div>

    <div class="intro__body">
      <p class="intro__summary">
        We combine acoustic ecology and spatial design to transform natural soundscapes into <strong>auditable biodiversity data</strong> and <strong>immersive wellness experiences</strong>.
      </p>

      <div class="intro__target">
        <p class="intro__target-title">Solutions designed for:</p>
        <ul class="intro__list">
          <li>
            <strong>ESG corporations & enterprises:</strong> Tangible impact activations and biodiversity metrics.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Ecotourism & sustainable resorts:</strong> High-value sensory differentiation for guests.
          </li>
          <li>
            <strong>Natural parks & Smart Cities:</strong> Biomonitoring infrastructure and environmental education.
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

